<td>-</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>cancel-text</td>
<td>取消按钮的内容</td>
<td><code v-pre>string</code></td>
<td>-</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>ok-loading</td>
<td>确认按钮是否为加载中状态</td>
